  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Assistance technique a la mise en oeuvre du Programme d&apos;Appui a la concurrence et a la securite des produits de Consommation en Afrique subsaharienne-Composante Afrique de l&apos;Ouest (UEMOA-CEDEAO)- PACoSPro</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;This intervention intends to strengthen Sub-Saharan Africa Competition regime and Consumer Welfare. This with an aim to increase intra-African and EU-Africa trade by improving SSA&#xbf;s business environment to attract investment, to benefit African and EU consumers and businesses, and to create decent jobs.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(13, 13, 13);&quot;&gt;The core support of this Action will focus on competition, consumer welfare, and consumer product safety regulatory and policy frameworks, their enforcement and their understanding and compliance by stakeholders.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
